text:
“What doesn't kill you makes you stronger.”

No, I think there are three types of things:

a) things that kill you, e.g. being eaten by a tiger;
b) things that don't kill you &amp; make you stronger, e.g. lifting weights;
c) things that don't kill you &amp; make you weaker, e.g. poison

